(45, 'how can partnering with us help grow your brand?', '<p>Grow your brand and build customer trust through reliable logistics solutions, consistent delivery performance, and a strong global presence.</p>', 'partnership', 1, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-07-29 05:44:52'),
(46, 'How can partnering with us help grow your brand?', 'Grow your brand and build customer trust through reliable logistics solutions, consistent delivery performance, and a strong global presence.', 'partnership', 1, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(47, 'What global reach do our partnership services offer?', 'Our platform connects you to 220+ countries, enabling seamless international shipping and expanding your business footprint worldwide.', 'partnership', 2, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(48, 'What global reach do our partnership services offer?', 'Our platform connects you to 220+ countries, enabling seamless international shipping and expanding your business footprint worldwide.', 'partnership', 2, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(49, 'How strong is our partner network?', 'Join a trusted network of 25K+ exporters, built to support business growth, collaboration, and long-term success.', 'partnership', 3, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(50, 'How strong is our partner network?', 'Join a trusted network of 25K+ exporters, built to support business growth, collaboration, and long-term success.', 'partnership', 3, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(51, 'What exclusive benefits do partners receive?', 'Partners get exclusive access to webinars, training sessions, and growth opportunities designed to enhance business capabilities and market reach.', 'partnership', 4, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(52, 'What exclusive benefits do partners receive?', 'Partners get exclusive access to webinars, training sessions, and growth opportunities designed to enhance business capabilities and market reach.', 'partnership', 4, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(53, 'How do we support your business growth through logistics?', 'We simplify logistics operations while helping you build growth and trust for your business through efficient, reliable, and scalable solutions.', 'partnership', 5, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(54, 'How do we support your business growth through logistics?', 'We simplify logistics operations while helping you build growth and trust for your business through efficient, reliable, and scalable solutions.', 'partnership', 5, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(55, 'How easy is it to start a partnership with us?', 'Getting started is simple&mdash;register with us, connect with our team, and begin accessing our logistics network and partner benefits quickly.', 'partnership', 6, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(56, 'How easy is it to start a partnership with us?', 'Getting started is simple&mdash;register with us, connect with our team, and begin accessing our logistics network and partner benefits quickly.', 'partnership', 6, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(57, 'Do partners receive dedicated support?', 'Yes, our partners receive dedicated support to ensure smooth operations, quick issue resolution, and consistent business growth.', 'partnership', 7, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(58, 'Do partners receive dedicated support?', 'Yes, our partners receive dedicated support to ensure smooth operations, quick issue resolution, and consistent business growth.', 'partnership', 7, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(59, 'Can partnerships help expand into new markets?', 'Absolutely. Our global network and logistics expertise make it easier for partners to enter and succeed in new international markets.', 'partnership', 8, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(60, 'Can partnerships help expand into new markets?', 'Absolutely. Our global network and logistics expertise make it easier for partners to enter and succeed in new international markets.', 'partnership', 8, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(61, 'What makes our partnership model reliable?', 'Our combination of strong network, advanced systems, and strict quality control ensures reliable and consistent logistics services for all partners.', 'partnership', 9, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(62, 'What makes our partnership model reliable?', 'Our combination of strong network, advanced systems, and strict quality control ensures reliable and consistent logistics services for all partners.', 'partnership', 9, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(63, 'Do partners get access to learning and development resources?', 'Yes, we provide ongoing learning opportunities including webinars, training modules, and expert sessions to help partners grow continuously.', 'partnership', 10, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(64, 'Do partners get access to learning and development resources?', 'Yes, we provide ongoing learning opportunities including webinars, training modules, and expert sessions to help partners grow continuously.', 'partnership', 10, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(65, 'How does our platform build long-term trust for partners?', 'By ensuring transparent processes, reliable delivery, and consistent service quality, we help partners build long-term trust with their customers.', 'partnership', 11, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(66, 'How does our platform build long-term trust for partners?', 'By ensuring transparent processes, reliable delivery, and consistent service quality, we help partners build long-term trust with their customers.', 'partnership', 11, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(67, 'How do I get started?', 'To connect with our team, you have to register yourself, get a quote, and schedule your first pickup. Thereafter, the team will guide you through every step of the process.', 'warehousing', 27, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(68, 'How does United Worldwide Couriers meet your shipping and logistics needs?', 'To provide the best freight management solutions, we work with broad strategies, technologies, and services to simplify the planning, storage, and movement of goods.', 'warehousing', 28, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(69, 'What packaging standards should we follow for shipping?', 'We utilize study and secure packaging for small to large packages to protect your goods during transit. In case of fragile items, they will be cushioned enough and clearly labelled as \"Fragile\". In addition, we also provide a packaging and labelling guide for all new on boarders for no confusion and faster results.', 'warehousing', 29, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(70, 'How do we calculate cost?', 'The exact shipping cost will be calculated based on your goods\' weight, dimensions, destinations, where it is expected to be delivered, and the delivery speed. If you are interested in knowing the accurate pricing, you are welcome to connect with the team.', 'warehousing', 30, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(71, 'Will I be notified about my shipment status?', 'Yes. To keep the clients informed, our team provides regular updates via email or SMS throughout the shipping process.', 'warehousing', 31, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(72, 'Does United Worldwide Couriers handle bulk or commercial shipments?', 'Yes, we specialize in managing bulk as well as commercial consignments with easy-flowing coordination, dedicated handling, secure transit, and timely delivery. This remains the same for both small and large volumes.', 'warehousing', 32, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(73, 'Can I schedule a pickup for my shipment?', 'Yes, you can easily schedule a pick up at your preferred time either by reaching out to our team online (via our website) or by directly contacting our customer support.', 'warehousing', 33, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(74, 'How can I track my shipment?', 'Through our online tracking system, you can track your shipment in real-time. For that, you just have to enter the tracking ID provided on our website dashboard to get live updates.', 'warehousing', 34, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(75, 'Will my package be picked up by the United Worldwide Couriers team only?', 'It depends on the service and location. So, your shipment may be picked up either by our in-house delivery team or by third-party courier partners. On the contrary, we ensure strict quality control and safe handling for whatever the case may be.', 'warehousing', 35, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(76, 'Do you provide customs clearance support?', 'Yes, while others face limited support, we complete international customs documentation and clearance faster. This way, we support rapid shipping without delays.', 'warehousing', 36, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(77, 'What happens if my shipment is delayed or stuck?', 'First things first, the team proactively monitors the shipment to identify and resolve potential issues before they escalate. Still, if an issue occurs, the internal team coordinates with the partners to resolve the situation quickly.', 'warehousing', 37, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(78, 'How do I get started?', 'To connect with our team, you have to register yourself, get a quote, and schedule your first pickup. Thereafter, the team will guide you through every step of the process.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 2, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(79, 'How does United Worldwide Couriers meet your shipping and logistics needs?', 'To provide the best freight management solutions, we work with broad strategies, technologies, and services to simplify the planning, storage, and movement of goods.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 3, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(80, 'What packaging standards should we follow for shipping?', 'We utilize study and secure packaging for small to large packages to protect your goods during transit. In case of fragile items, they will be cushioned enough and clearly labelled as \"Fragile\". In addition, we also provide a packaging and labelling guide for all new on boarders for no confusion and faster results.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 4, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(81, 'How do we calculate cost?', 'The exact shipping cost will be calculated based on your goods\' weight, dimensions, destinations, where it is expected to be delivered, and the delivery speed. If you are interested in knowing the accurate pricing, you are welcome to connect with the team.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 5, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(82, 'Will I be notified about my shipment status?', 'Yes. To keep the clients informed, our team provides regular updates via email or SMS throughout the shipping process.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 6, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(83, 'Does United Worldwide Couriers handle bulk or commercial shipments?', 'Yes, we specialize in managing bulk as well as commercial consignments with easy-flowing coordination, dedicated handling, secure transit, and timely delivery. This remains the same for both small and large volumes.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 7, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(84, 'Can I schedule a pickup for my shipment?', 'Yes, you can easily schedule a pick up at your preferred time either by reaching out to our team online (via our website) or by directly contacting our customer support.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 8, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(85, 'How can I track my shipment?', 'Through our online tracking system, you can track your shipment in real-time. For that, you just have to enter the tracking ID provided on our website dashboard to get live updates.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 9, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(86, 'Will my package be picked up by the United Worldwide Couriers team only?', 'It depends on the service and location. So, your shipment may be picked up either by our in-house delivery team or by third-party courier partners. On the contrary, we ensure strict quality control and safe handling for whatever the case may be.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 10, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(87, 'Do you provide customs clearance support?', 'Yes, while others face limited support, we complete international customs documentation and clearance faster. This way, we support rapid shipping without delays.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 11, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(88, 'What happens if my shipment is delayed or stuck?', 'First things first, the team proactively monitors the shipment to identify and resolve potential issues before they escalate. Still, if an issue occurs, the internal team coordinates with the partners to resolve the situation quickly.', 'ecommerce-logistics', 12, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(89, 'What is the standard timeframe for United Worldwide Couriers to arrange an air express pickup?', 'As soon as you complete the registration process and submit a quote request, our staff will start working right away and arrange a pickup at your preferred time. Additionally, you can speak with our support staff directly about urgent consignments so that we can give your reservations top priority.', 'express-air-freight', 2, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(90, 'Which types of cargo does your Air Express service handle?', 'We handle commercial goods, B2B consignments, e-commerce shipments, high-value goods, industrial parts, and personal import packages. However, each cargo will be handled according to its specific requirements.', 'express-air-freight', 3, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(91, 'How is the air express cost calculated?', 'The shipping cost for air express solutions is calculated on the basis of the weight and dimensions of the cargo, the destination country, and the speed of delivery required. However, volumetric weight is applied where applicable.', 'express-air-freight', 4, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(92, 'Does United Worldwide Couriers manage customs clearance for international air freight?', 'Yes, United Worldwide Courier’s customs brokerage team can handle all export and import documentation, pre-clearance filings, and compliance requirements for every international shipment. This is how we ensure that your cargo clears borders easily.', 'express-air-freight', 5, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(93, 'What happens if my air express shipment is delayed in transit?', 'At each checkpoint, we monitor shipments and spot problems before they get out of hand. The internal coordination team immediately connects with the airline partners and ground handlers to address the situation and, if feasible, reroute or expedite the flight.', 'express-air-freight', 6, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(94, 'Does United Worldwide Couriers offer real-time tracking?', 'Yes, every shipment booked through United Worldwide Couriers is assigned a unique tracking ID. This ID will be accessible through our live dashboard. From there, you can monitor the status of the cargo at every checkpoint.', 'express-air-freight', 7, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(95, 'Does Air Express have a minimum or maximum weight limit for packages?', 'There is no minimum weight to use our air express service. In case of oversized or overweight cargo, the team ensures the best routing and handling options.', 'express-air-freight', 8, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(96, 'How do I get started with United Worldwide Couriers if I am a first-time customer?', 'First, you have to register your business account on our platform. Then, share your business details. Thereafter, our team will provide a quote and walk you through the entire process.', 'express-air-freight', 9, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(97, 'Will my package be picked up by the United Worldwide Couriers team only?', 'It depends on the service and location. So, your shipment may be picked up either by our in-house delivery team or by third-party courier partners.', 'express-air-freight', 10, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(98, 'Do you provide customs clearance support?', 'Yes, while others face limited support, we complete international customs documentation and clearance faster.', 'express-air-freight', 11, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(99, 'What happens if my shipment is delayed or stuck?', 'First things first, the team proactively monitors the shipment to identify and resolve potential issues before they escalate.', 'express-air-freight', 12, 0, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
